          %h2#references References
          %p
            For more see the references at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/analysis"} analysis
          %ul
            %li#Bourbaki71
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nicolas+Bourbaki"}> Nicolas Bourbaki
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Real Numbers
              = succeed "," do
                %em General topology
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-61701-0"} doi:10.1007/978-3-642-61701-0
          %p Review and history:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Leo+Corry"}> Leo Corry
              , §10.5 in:
              = succeed "," do
                %em A Brief History of Numbers
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://global.oup.com/academic/product/a-brief-history-of-numbers-9780198702597"} ISBN:9780198702597
          %p
            As the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coalgebra+of+the+real+interval"} coalgebra of the real interval
          %ul
            %li#PavlovicPratt
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dusko+Pavlovic"}> Dusko Pavlovic
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vaughan+Pratt"} Vaughan Pratt
              = succeed "," do
                %em On coalgebra of real numbers
              %strong 19
              (1999) 103-117, doi:
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S1571-0661%2805%2980272-5"}> 10.1016/S1571-0661(05)80272-5
              ,
              %a{:href => "http://citeseerx.ist.psu.edu/viewdoc/summary?doi=10.1.1.47.5204"} CiteSeerx
          %p
            A definition of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/real+numbers"} real numbers
            as
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+the"} the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/terminal+object"} terminal
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Archimedean+ordered+field"} Archimedean ordered field
            and as a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complete+space"} complete
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Archimedean+ordered+field"} Archimedean ordered field
          %ul
            %li#Richman08
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fred+Richman"}> Fred Richman
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Real numbers and other completions
              %strong 54
              1 (2008) 98-108 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/malq.200710024"}> doi:10.1002/malq.200710024
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            A compact category
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi ℝ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}
            making the
            = succeed "-linear" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi ℝ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}
            = succeed "-enriched" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi ℝ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}
          %ul
            %li#Pavlovic
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dusko+Pavlovic"}> Dusko Pavlovic
              ,
              %em From process-propositions-as-types to categorified real numbers
              %p
                and monoidal computers_, Logic and Structure in Computer Science 1000-1070, doi:
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-24117-8"}> 10.1007/978-3-031-24117-8
                ,
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2007.10057v3"} arXiv:2007.10057
          %p
            The definition of the real numbers in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/constructive+analysis"} constructive analysis
            as
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cauchy+real+numbers"} Cauchy real numbers
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/regular+sequences"} regular
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cauchy+sequences"} Cauchy sequences
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rational+numbers"} rational numbers
            is due to:
          %ul
            %li#Bishop67
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Errett+Bishop"}> Errett Bishop
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Foundations+of+Constructive+Analysis"} Foundations of Constructive Analysis
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Errett+Bishop"}> Errett Bishop
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Douglas+Bridges"} Douglas Bridges
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Constructive+Analysis"} Constructive Analysis
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 279
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-61667-9"} doi:10.1007/978-3-642-61667-9
          %p
            Direct formalization of the definition of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cauchy+real+numbers"} Cauchy real numbers
            from
            %a{:href => "#Bishop67"} Bishop (1967)
            in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Agda"} Agda
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Martin+Lundfall"}> Martin Lundfall
                ,
                %em Formalizing real numbers in Agda
                (2015) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://wcl.cs.rpi.edu/pilots/library/papers/TAGGED/4211-Lundfall%20(2015)%20-%20Formalizing%20Real%20Numbers%20in%20Agda.pdf"}> pdf
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Lundfall-RealNumbersInAgda.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://github.com/MrChico/Reals-in-agda"} github
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zachary+Murray"}> Zachary Murray
                ,
                %em Constructive Analysis in the Agda Proof Assistant
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.08354"}> arXiv:2205.08354
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://github.com/z-murray/honours-project-constructive-analysis-in-agda"} github
          %p review:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zachary+Murray"}> Zachary Murray
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Constructive Real Numbers in the Agda Proof Assistant
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "Center+for+Quantum+and+Topological+Systems#MurrayFeb2023"}
                  talk at
                  %em CQTS
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Q_sjfyPJqU"} YT
          %p
            and closely related constructions in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Coq"} Coq
            have been implemented in
          %ul
            %li#KrebbersSpitters11
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robbert+Krebbers"}> Robbert Krebbers
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bas+Spitters"} Bas Spitters
              = succeed "," do
                %em Type classes for efficient exact real arithmetic in Coq
              %strong 9
              1 (2013) lmcs:958 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1106.3448/"}> arXiv:1106.3448
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.2168/LMCS-9(1:1)2013"} doi:10.2168/LMCS-9(1:1)2013
          %p
            following a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monad+%28in+computer+science%29"} monadic
            re-formulation (via the
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/completion+monad"} completion monad
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Russell+O%27Connor"}> Russell O'Connor
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em A Monadic, Functional Implementation of Real Numbers
              %strong 17
              1 (2007) 129-159 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/cs/0605058"}> arXiv:cs/0605058
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/S0960129506005871"} doi:10.1017/S0960129506005871
          %p
            Overview of implementation of real numbers in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/proof+assistants"} proof assistants
            (cf.
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/constructive+analysis"} constructive analysis
          %ul
            %li
              Sylvie Boldo, Catherine Lelay, Guillaume Melquiond,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Formalization of Real Analysis: A Survey of Proof Assistants and Libraries
              %strong 26
              7 (2016) 1196-1233 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://hal.inria.fr/hal-00806920v1"}> hal:00806920
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/S0960129514000437"} doi:10.1017/S0960129514000437
          %p
            A novel construction principle of the type of real numbers, as a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+inductive-inductive+type"} higher inductive-inductive type
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/univalence+axiom"} univalent
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+type+theory"} homotopy type theory
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rational+numbers"} rational numbers
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cauchy+completeness"} Cauchy completeness
            even without extra
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/axiom+of+countable+choice"} axiom of countable choice
            is laid out (cf.
            = succeed ")" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/HoTT+book+real+numbers"} HoTT book real numbers
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Univalent+Foundations+Project"}> Univalent Foundations Project
              \: Chapter 11 of:
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Homotopy+Type+Theory+%E2%80%93+Univalent+Foundations+of+Mathematics"} Homotopy Type Theory – Univalent Foundations of Mathematics
              (2013) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://homotopytypetheory.org/book/"}> web
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "http://hottheory.files.wordpress.com/2013/03/hott-online-323-g28e4374.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Something like this has been implemented in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Coq"} Coq
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ga%C3%ABtan+Gilbert"}> Gaëtan Gilbert
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Formalising Real Numbers in Homotopy Type Theory
              %em CPP 2017: Proceedings of the 6th ACM SIGPLAN Conference on Certified Programs and Proofs
              (2017) 112–124 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1610.05072"}> arXiv:1610.05072
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1145/3018610.3018614"} doi:10.1145/3018610.3018614
        .revisedby
